To run the application manually, open two different terminals and run the following commands:

**Terminal 1 (Frontend)**
1. Navigate to the frontend directory:
   `cd backend\crm-jot-frontend`
2. Start the React app:
   `npm start`

**Terminal 2 (Backend)**
1. Navigate to the backend directory:
   `cd backend`
2. Start the Node.js server:
   `node server.js`

(Note: The Python docplatform backend has been completely removed. Document generation and PDF conversion are now handled natively by the Node.js backend).